  <body>
    <front><contents /></front>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOBulkV2Blobs class
      </heading>
      <class name="TTIOBulkV2Blobs" super="NSObject">
        <declared>TTIOBulkV2Blobs.h</declared>
        <desc>
          <p>
            <em>Inherits From:</em> NSObject
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>Conforms To:</em> NSObject (NSObject)
          </p>
          <p>
            <em>Declared In:</em> Genomics/TTIOBulkV2Blobs.h
          </p>
          <p>
            Phase 2c-T : verbatim v2 codec blobs for direct
            on-disk write. Set on a
            <code>TTIOWrittenGenomicRun</code> to bypass the v2
            codec encode step in the writer and write the blob
            bytes directly to the matching HDF5 paths. Used by
            the transport bulk-mode receiver (see
            <code>docs/transport-spec.md</code> §6.4).
          </p>
          <p>
            Each field is independently optional. When
            <code>mateInfoBlob</code> is non-nil,
            <code>mateInfoChromNames</code> MUST also be
            supplied. <code>refDiffBlob</code> requires
            <code>refDiffReferenceUri</code> which the writer
            validates against the run's
            <code>referenceUri</code>.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Cross-language equivalents:</strong>
            <br /> Python:
            <code>ttio.written_genomic_run.BulkV2Blobs</code>
            <br /> Java:
            <code>
              global.thalion.ttio.genomics.BulkV2Blobs
            </code>
          </p>
        </desc>
      </class>
    </chapter>
  </body>
</gsdoc>
